# Espionage Mod files
#
# I have organized the mod files so that all the data associated with
# an item, for example, are together in a single file, to make it easier
# to create and debug specific gear, classes, characters, and stories

# Items
#
# Each item file contains all the associated data for the following
# tables, as needed, as well as the locale strings:
#
# Item, Talent, Effect, MissionLoot, MissionAdvantage, Blueprint

Source_JSON/Item_Buzzcut.json
Source_JSON/Item_Chameleon_Cloak.json
Source_JSON/Item_Disguise.json
Source_JSON/Item_E-Pulse.json
